# An allowlist, because the tree holds things that must never reach a build:
# .env carries the HA token and the model key, dev/home-assistant/config holds
# the local Home Assistant's accounts. BuildKit reads this file because it sits
# beside rel/Dockerfile under that name.
*
!mix.exs
!mix.lock
!config/config.exs
!config/prod.exs
!config/runtime.exs
!lib
!priv
!assets
!rel
priv/static/assets
priv/static/cache_manifest.json
rel/Dockerfile
rel/Dockerfile.dockerignore
